 SelectionToolWithLongCaption;globalParms;list;parms;n1;boolean;flag
⍝ Presents a list of any length and allows selecting a single row; this comes with a very long caption.
 globalParms←##.APLGUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 globalParms.regKey←'MyApp'
 globalParms.caption←'This is my main application'
 globalParms.icon←#.⎕NEW'Icon'(⊂'File'(GetFile'Misc\Sample.ico'))
 list←((⊂'. '),¨⍨⍕¨⍳200),¨200⍴#.⎕NL-3
 parms←##.APLGUI.SelectionTool.CreateParms
 parms.addToCaption←'Please select from list the items you would like to process'
 parms.default←(⍳⍴list)∊98
 n1←globalParms parms ##.APLGUI.SelectionTool.Create list
 (flag boolean)←##.APLGUI.SelectionTool.ModalWait n1
 :If flag
     ⎕←' User pressed the OK button'
     ⎕←boolean/list
 :Else
     ⎕←'User did NOT press the OK button'
 :EndIf
